# What Railway leaves out of the server build (Railpack reads this file).
# The server runs `next build` / `next start` and reads only content/ at run
# time; pictures come from R2 (content/<country>/images.json), and proxy.ts
# answers 404 to everything but /v1, /api/admin and /healthz, so nothing here
# is ever served. public/images alone was 868 MB, copied, packed and pushed on
# every deploy of both services (Josh, 2026-11-06: "how can we speed up that
# deploy?", "why have them in the build at all").
